      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "When `attachableValue` is an instance of a type that does not conform to the [`Sendable`](https://developer.apple.comhttps://developer.apple.com/documentation/swift/sendable) protocol, the testing library calls its [`withUnsafeBytes(for:_:)`](attachable/withunsafebytes(for:_:).md) immediately and records a copy of the resulting buffer instead.",
      "normalizedSource": "When `attachableValue` is an instance of a type that does not conform to the [`Sendable`](https://developer.apple.comhttps://developer.apple.com/documentation/swift/sendable) protocol, the testing library calls its [`withUnsafeBytes(for:_:)`](attachable/withunsafebytes(for:_:).md) immediately and records a copy of the resulting buffer instead.",
